<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="27df9544">&lt;p&gt;
    The learning plan encompasses various elements such as curriculum design, content development, learing delivery
    mechanisms, logistical arrangements, and post-implementation evaluation. It takes into account the unique needs of the
    workforce and aligns learning objectives with the organization&apos;s goals and timeline.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The delivery plan sets out the key actions to help deliver the learning activities (administration and logistics). The
    development plan determines who is in charge of the development of what content.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
